OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAfter a wet
OL,6,Fand cloudy day, skies will clear
OL,7,Fresulting in a dry night. Temperatures
OL,8,Fwill fall making it feel cooler than
OL,9,Fof late. The wind eases inland but
OL,10,Fremaining breezy along the coast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FFine and sunny for the most
OL,13,Fpart on Thursday, after a cool
OL,14,Fmorning. Clouding over by late
OL,15,Fafternoon or evening, ahead of rain
OL,16,Fand stronger winds spreading east
OL,17,Fovernight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
