OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fwith outbreaks of rain Friday,
OL,7,Fclearing in the afternoon or evening.
OL,8,FBreezy, with a sunny start to Saturday
OL,9,Fbut afternoon showers for some. Drier
OL,10,Fand more settled on Sunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
